3. Hypertension that has not received regular antihypertensive treatment or is poorly controlled despite treatment: during the screening period, systolic blood pressure greater than 160 mmHg, or diastolic blood pressure greater than 100 mmHg (excluding abnormalities during the peri-anesthetic period).
